          "remark_en": "This ticket only grants access to the BTOC Exhibition Area (Hall N, Hall E).\nMinors under 14 years old are not allowed to attend this exhibition.\n\nVIP Package Collection: VIP attendees shall collect their packages at the VIP Ticket Holder Collection Counter between Gate 4 and Gate 5 of Hall E6. Please present your bound real-name identification document for collection.\nAttendees with cosplay needs shall purchase exclusive access tickets via the Damai App.\n\nNotes: No on-site ticket sales available. Visitors who have purchased merchandise package tickets cannot buy general admission tickets for the same date. Please arrange your ticket purchase plan accordingly.",
