          "remark_zh": "此门票只可进入BTOC展区（N馆、E馆）\n14周岁以下未成年人无法参加本次展会；\n购买本系列指定角色套票的玩家将会获得：当日普通/VIP门票+所选角色对应的5款精美周边，含徽章*1，立牌*1，卡套挂件*1，金属徽章*1，鼠标垫*1（共2款，莫雨&穆玄英款，谢渊&王遗风款），套装价值186元，同时还可获赠联名纸袋+对应角色杯垫*1哦~\n衍生品领取：观展当日，前往ChinaJoy x 剑网3“双星承溯”套票领取处-位于上海新国际博览中心N2馆N2-14展台，通过实名身份证件核销进行领取。\n\n注：现场无售票点，已购买衍生品套票的观众，无法再次购买相同日期的观众票，请合理安排购票计划。\n有COS需求的玩家请前往“大麦App”购买专属通道门票；\n",
          "remark_en": "This ticket grants access only to the BTOC Exhibition Area (Halls N and E).\nMinors under 14 years old are not permitted to attend this exhibition.\nPurchasers of designated character package tickets in this series will receive: a standard/VIP admission ticket valid for the same day plus 5 exquisite official merchandise items corresponding to the selected character, including 1 badge, 1 acrylic standee, 1 card holder charm, 1 metal badge, and 1 mouse pad (available in two designs: Mo Yu & Mu Xuanying, and Xie Yuan & Wang Yifeng). The package is valued at 186 RMB. Buyers will also receive a co-branded paper bag and 1 character-specific coaster as a complimentary gift.\n\nMerchandise Collection: On the day of your visit, proceed to the ChinaJoy x JX3 \"Dual Stars Retrospect\" Package Ticket Collection Counter at Booth N2-14, Hall N2, Shanghai New International Expo Centre. Present your valid real-name identity document for verification to claim your merchandise.\n\nNotes: No on-site ticket sales are available. Visitors",
          "introduction": "admin/ticket_detail/1784357546091/宣发长图（衍生品新）.jpg,admin/ticket_detail/1784357555188/VIP.png",
